ures know the Ark's location.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_21","text":"They're just moving towards the general area they heard the sound on the assumption something must be there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_22","text":"They're moving towards the sound without even knowing what called them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_23","text":"We don't need a lecture on Rapture psychology. Just tell us what we need to do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_24","text":"We flank them from the rear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_25","text":"A sneak attack from behind? Such cowardice!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_26","text":"Yes, very cowardly.\nEnough to attract the attention of the Raptures going forward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_27","text":"Very good!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_28","text":"What does that mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_29","text":"First we're going to eliminate the Raptures towards the back, then move forward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_30","text":"They'll start to think,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_31","text":"Are the people following us from behind the ones who sent the signal?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_32","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_18_10_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_18_10_33","text":"Even if we don't succeed in attracting their attention, there's at least a possibility of approaching the front while reducing the number of Raptures as much as possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"b